# Mixed mappings, all CCW from the front: baseline, duplicate (dedup),
# rotated, flipped, non-axis-aligned, transparent sampling, negative indices.
mtllib test.mtl
# Face0 baseline quad at x=0
v 0.0 1.0 0.0
v 2.0 1.0 0.0
v 2.0 -1.0 0.0
v 0.0 -1.0 0.0
# Face1 duplicate geometry shifted +4 in x
v 4.0 1.0 0.0
v 6.0 1.0 0.0
v 6.0 -1.0 0.0
v 4.0 -1.0 0.0
# Face2 rotated mapping, at x=8
v 8.0 1.0 0.0
v 10.0 1.0 0.0
v 10.0 -1.0 0.0
v 8.0 -1.0 0.0
# Face3 flipped mapping, at x=12
v 12.0 1.0 0.0
v 14.0 1.0 0.0
v 14.0 -1.0 0.0
v 12.0 -1.0 0.0
# Face4 non-axis-aligned mapping, at x=16
v 16.0 1.0 0.0
v 18.0 1.0 0.0
v 18.0 -1.0 0.0
v 16.0 -1.0 0.0
# Face5 transparent sampling, at x=20
v 20.0 1.0 0.0
v 22.0 1.0 0.0
v 22.0 -1.0 0.0
v 20.0 -1.0 0.0
# Face6 negative-index quad, at x=24
v 24.0 1.0 0.0
v 26.0 1.0 0.0
v 26.0 -1.0 0.0
v 24.0 -1.0 0.0
# UVs 1-4: opaque top half BL/BR/TR/TL; 5-8 duplicate; 9-12 rotated set;
# 13-16 flipped set; 17-20 diagonal red quadrant; 21-24 transparent corner;
# 25-28 baseline again.
vt 0.0 0.5
vt 1.0 0.5
vt 1.0 1.0
vt 0.0 1.0
vt 0.0 0.5
vt 1.0 0.5
vt 1.0 1.0
vt 0.0 1.0
vt 1.0 0.5
vt 1.0 1.0
vt 0.0 1.0
vt 0.0 0.5
vt 1.0 0.5
vt 0.0 0.5
vt 0.0 1.0
vt 1.0 1.0
vt 0.05 0.65
vt 0.4 0.65
vt 0.4 0.9
vt 0.05 0.9
vt 0.94 0.06
vt 1.0 0.06
vt 1.0 0.0
vt 0.94 0.0
vt 0.0 0.5
vt 1.0 0.5
vt 1.0 1.0
vt 0.0 1.0
usemtl TestMat
f 4/1 3/2 2/3 1/4
f 8/5 7/6 6/7 5/8
f 12/9 11/10 10/11 9/12
f 16/13 15/14 14/15 13/16
f 20/17 19/18 18/19 17/20
f 24/21 23/22 22/23 21/24
f -1/-4 -2/-3 -3/-2 -4/-1
